<title>POLAND: OKOCIM MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 3.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>OKOCIM MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 3.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.91 vs   5.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.96 vs   7.92</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.04 vs   6.34</p>
<p> Sales		   39.95 vs  26.68</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.59 vs   9.51</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	18.25 vs  15.86</p>
<p> Operating profit    12.68 vs  17.11</p>
<p> Sales		  122.75 vs  78.78</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewer is Okocimskie Zaklady</p>
<p>Piwowarskie Okocim SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
